  <!-- EN: Arachna Drone -->
  <OE_Mech_ArachnaDrone.label>蜘蛛无人机</OE_Mech_ArachnaDrone.label>
  <!-- EN: A small, deployable combat mechanoid usually manufactured inside an ultra-heavy Arachna Queen mech. Arachna Drone are expendable melee fighters designed to swarm-attack enemies. They are mounted with non-rechargeable power source. -->
  <OE_Mech_ArachnaDrone.description>一种小型可部署的战斗机械体，通常在超重型蜘蛛女王机械体内制造。蜘蛛无人机是一次性近战战士，设计用于群攻敌人。它们配备了不可充电的电源。</OE_Mech_ArachnaDrone.description>
